WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:01.250
- Is this for the Oklahoma job?

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.916
- It’s the Week 14 playoff picture.

00:00:02.916 --> 00:00:04.041
- Oh...yay.

00:00:04.041 --> 00:00:06.041
- Hey, I'm late-season Lenny! The main star of the Bucs!

00:00:06.041 --> 00:00:08.166
- ELISHA, YOU SCARED BRADY AWAY AGAIN.

00:00:08.166 --> 00:00:09.208
- WELL, YOUR FOREHEAD IS—

00:00:09.416 --> 00:00:11.291
We’re trying to make a perfect picture.

00:00:11.291 --> 00:00:12.583
- OK, but no one's good enough.

00:00:12.666 --> 00:00:13.166
- Aw.

00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:13.791
- Oww.

00:00:14.166 --> 00:00:15.708
- Ummm, I blame Detroit!

00:00:15.708 --> 00:00:16.041
- Still?

00:00:16.166 --> 00:00:17.208
- McCarthy, what's your deal?

00:00:17.208 --> 00:00:19.458
- We’re all vaccinated in some way.

00:00:19.791 --> 00:00:21.708
- THERE AIN'T NO SHADOW COACH. LOOK AWAY.

00:00:21.708 --> 00:00:24.375
♪♪♪

00:00:24.375 --> 00:00:26.291
- Let's get the good AFC teams in.

00:00:26.791 --> 00:00:28.666
- I'm too strong for my crutches.

00:00:28.666 --> 00:00:31.791
- We realized we needed to ManningCast the parts.

00:00:31.791 --> 00:00:33.541
- I could be a contender.

00:00:33.541 --> 00:00:34.791
- I don't believe you.

00:00:34.791 --> 00:00:35.958
- I'm the three seed!

00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:38.625
- ♪♪♪ I COULD BE A CONTENDER! ♪♪♪

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.041
- I could be a contender?

00:00:40.041 --> 00:00:42.041
- Hey, kid…I could be a contender.

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:44.833
- We’ll see if the makeup folks can get rid of the whole, you know, Bengals thing.

00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:47.666
[Peyton Manning:] Where’s Deebo? He's supposed to play two roles.

00:00:47.666 --> 00:00:50.041
- Time for the playoff picture...Taylor's version.

00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:51.666
- Sorry, I was in the wrong studio.

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:53.041
- We're like a Lifetime movie.

00:00:53.208 --> 00:00:56.166
Quality doesn't matter here. The fans eat up whatever we give them.

00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:56.458
- [Together:] Got it.

00:00:56.458 --> 00:00:58.083
- Push.
- Push, you push.
- You don't pull.

00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:00.291
- Pull? Sorry, nothing is easy for us!

00:01:00.291 --> 00:01:01.541
- Omaha, everyone ready?

00:01:01.541 --> 00:01:02.791
- Swamp cat's now swamp bird!

00:01:02.791 --> 00:01:03.791
- And, rolling!

00:01:04.041 --> 00:01:06.416
- OK, so this is actually, like, a conspiracy, right?

00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:12.916
- Stupid playoff picture. Ciara and I take better photos several million times a day—

00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:15.791
- You think you’re the only disgruntled athlete?

00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:17.291
- Who the hell are you?

00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:22.416
- I’m Clammy and I’m here to talk to you about the Delaware Clams.

